.TH DRAGONGL_CLIENT 1 "2026-10-27" "DragonGL+ 2026.10" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dragongl_client \- Dragon GL 3D game client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dragongl_client
.RI "[ options ]"
.RI "[ gl | vk ]"
.RI "[ server_ip " "[ port ] ]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dragongl_client
is the graphical client of the Dragon GL dungeon crawler. It opens on a
title menu from which the player can:
.TP
.B Play Solo
start a private game: the client launches
.BR dragongl_server (1)
in the background (local connections only, random port and password) and
keeps its world and heroes under
.I ~/.config/dragongl/solo
.RI ( %APPDATA%\eDragonGL\esolo
on Windows);
.TP
.B Join a Server
connect to a multiplayer server (address, port, server password, hero
name and password); new heroes choose race and class with a 3D preview.
.PP
The whole interface is graphical (HUD, inventory, character sheet,
spellbook, shops, map, in-game guide on F1/H); the soundtrack and all
sound effects are synthesized in real time. Text commands can still be
typed in the chat (Enter, Tab completes).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR gl ", " \-\-gl
Use the OpenGL 3.3 renderer (default).
.TP
.BR vk ", " \-\-vk
Use the Vulkan 1.3 renderer. Without a Vulkan driver the client falls back
to OpenGL automatically.
.TP
.B \-\-fullscreen
Start in full screen.
.TP
.B \-\-windowed
Start in a window.
.TP
.I server_ip " [" port ]
Pre-fill the "Join a Server" form (default port 8080).
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the usage.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/dragongl/settings.ini
Graphics, audio, control and interface settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/dragongl/solo/
Solo world, heroes and the solo server log.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DRAGONGL_VK_VALIDATION
When set, enable the Khronos validation layer (Vulkan renderer).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dragongl_server (1),
.BR dragongl-client (1)
